      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنِقَ</span></b> , (S, Sgh, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنِقَ</span></b> ; (K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنَقَ</span>,
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنُقَ</span></b> ; (ISd, K;) inf. n. (of the former, S) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنَقٌ</span>
(S, K) and [of the latter] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنْقٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُنُوقٌ</span>; (K;)
<i>It</i> (water) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, turbid, thick,</i> or <i>muddy;</i> (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ترنّق</span></b> . (K.) ＝   
